Backport SwiftTerm PR #775 (5d6b3bf2b3667d03f753aa9f73b05175fcc4d357)
to the pinned 1.19.0 revision. Keep the 1.x terminal API and PTY integration.
Source: https://github.com/migueldeicaza/SwiftTerm/pull/775
Remove this patch when adopting an upstream version containing the fix.

